ral de Gaulle addressed a Branch meeting on one occasion.   How far-sighted it was of our predecessors to find and later invest in}{\fs22\lang1033\langfe1036\langnp1033\insrsid7015379  such central premises.  Our Secretary}{
\fs22\lang1033\langfe1036\langnp1033\insrsid13501520\charrsid16265379  recently unearthed a French newspaper dating from July 1924.  It reported on the Olympic Games then in full swing in Paris}{\fs22\lang1033\langfe1036\langnp1033\insrsid7015379  (\'93
